        "why": "The full moon: out of the window, past his friend, down the street on tiptoe."
      },
      {
        "from": "10.knelt",
        "mood": "tense",
        "why": "He kneels at the well. The last steps before the forbidden thing."
      },
      {
        "from": "11.air",
        "mood": "hope",
        "why": "He has a face and it is smiling. The music believes him; it is as wrong as he is."
      },
      {
        "from": "12.behind",
        "mood": "none",
        "why": "One held breath: the reflection has one head too many. A riser runs through the silence."
      },
      {
        "from": "13.tall",
        "mood": "dark",
        "why": "The reveal: what the rule was hiding."
      },
      {
        "from": "13.always",
        "mood": "sad",
        "why": "They had always been there. He understands, too late."
      },
      {
        "from": "14.looked",
        "mood": "dark",
        "why": "He has looked. They turn."
      },
      {
        "from": "14.day",
        "mood": "sad",
        "why": "Night turned to day: the town searches, and the music already knows."
      },
      {
        "from": "14.gone",
